WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.857 --> 00:00:05.127
In this video you'll choose lessons and brain games for your class.

2
00:00:05.629 --> 00:00:09.199
Open your classroom, and select the Assignments tab.

3
00:00:09.702 --> 00:00:19.842
Select Assign Lesson. A picker opens. Search by name, or narrow it with the series buttons. Choose a lesson, and set a due date if you'd like one.

4
00:00:20.343 --> 00:00:26.063
Then select Assign. The lesson appears in your list, with how many students have completed it.

5
00:00:26.564 --> 00:00:38.754
To assign a brain game, select Assign Game. It starts with games that fit your classroom's grade. If none fit, or if you want to see all of them, tick the box to show games for every grade band.

6
00:00:39.257 --> 00:00:42.407
Choose a game from the list, and select Assign.

7
00:00:42.909 --> 00:00:53.019
Each assignment shows how many students have finished it. Select Progress on a lesson, or Results on a game, to see the details. We cover those in another video.

8
00:00:53.520 --> 00:00:57.490
If you change your mind, select Remove next to the assignment.

9
00:00:57.991 --> 00:01:06.621
Students see their assigned lessons and games the next time they sign in. They can only open what you've assigned. Here's what a student sees.
